  "title": "PTP: Change field name from draft's version to standard's version",
  "description": "When the PTPv2 dissector code was added this was based on the then\navailable draft standard. In this draft the field logMessageInterval\nwas called logMessagePeriod. The name change never made it into the\ndissector code.\n\nChange the presented field into the standard's name while, for backward\ncompatibility reasons, retaining the pre-standard field as hidden.",
